---
const steps = [
  "Buyer asks a product question",
  "Agent checks Shopify context",
  "Cart intent is detected",
  "Recovery action is approved",
  "Revenue is attributed"
];
---

<section id="demo-flow" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#07111f] py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <div class="reveal-on-scroll chip mb-6">
          <span class="mini-label">Operating loop</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="reveal-on-scroll max-w-2xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          One clean path from question to revenue.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="reveal-on-scroll max-w-2xl text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        VoluChat is not another inbox view. It turns customer intent into a controlled commerce workflow: answer the buyer, watch the signal, ask for approval when needed, and record the result.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 border-y border-white/10 py-8">
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-5">
        {steps.map((step, index) => (
          <div class="reveal-on-scroll">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">0{index + 1}</span>
              <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/10"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="max-w-[16rem] text-lg font-semibold leading-tight text-white">{step}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center">
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        Example outcome: an Rs. 11,500 cart is recovered without giving the agent open-ended permission to discount or message customers freely.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary lg:justify-self-end">Map your workflow</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
